ber details. Matching X-end plaster profiles with 2 mm top-rail installation seam. Real open doorway, 0.98 m clear width and 2.05 m clear height measured above the 0.08 m threshold, with no door leaf. Cottage v2 supplies the appearance reference, not a directly interchangeable building system. Static visual module; no structural, collision or navigation claims.","bounds":{"x":2,"y":0.32,"z":2.6,"unit":"m"},"triangles":96,"materials":3,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/village/village-doorway-wall-2m-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":9744,"sha256":"2d0dd33e3699efed060ab61a245f71303c9f523b5fdb389cbb1b564080e0d2a5"},"blend":{"path":"assets/village/village-doorway-wall-2m-01/v1.0.0/source.blend","size":600700,"sha256":"c776e67c4c4c9dae7699e5fca5397b9814177ad2a312843934c6aa9131530fb6"},"generator":{"path":"assets/village/village-doorway-wall-2m-01/v1.0.0/generate.py","size":33762,"sha256":"aab54872bfe4165d4f7ca9667e6382cb56563f7c0e11f6bd126ff2b5ae9987fa"},"render":{"path":"assets/village/village-doorway-wall-2m-01/v1.0.0/thumbnail.png","size":315084,"sha256":"899640a2673c3b64fbc99c80980958df9d75dc829089e8f3c321492f0adbf6b8"}},"status":"verified","license":"All rights reserved","sourceId":"doorway-wall-extension"},{"id":"village-l-corner-wall-2m-01","version":"1.0.0","category":"architecture","assetKind":"modular","theme":"village","style":"warm-handcrafted-village","title":"L-Corner Timber Wall, 2 m Interfaces","description":"Independent S03 L-corner wall with a continuous L-shaped plaster body and one owned corner post. Actual outer bounds are 2.14 by 2.14 by 2.60 m; matching terminal planes are X=2 m and Y=2 m, measured from the ground-level corner grid origin. Straight wall companions mount at (3,0,0) and (0,3,0), with the latter rotated 90 degrees. No doubled corner columns or nonuniform scaling required. Warm timber and pale plaster follow the S03 family. Cottage v2 is an appearance reference, not an interchangeable source. Static visual architecture;","bounds":{"x":2.14,"y"